:""},"say:6:1910626005:1":{"text":"満ちては引く潮に、残る跡はなく。悠久の岩礁に、願いは永久に宿る。","source_cn":"潮升潮落，来去无痕；礁岩永伫，心愿长存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDC89AC030149F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910626006:1":{"text":"回遊季が始まると、ハダルたちは互いに争いをやめ、順番にここの石に言葉を刻む。すべての一族が昔からこの習わしを守っている。ここは深海で唯一平和な場所だ。","source_cn":"洄游季开始后，深海族裔之间会彼此休战，轮流在这里的石刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB9FAFF61F67A8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910626007:1":{"text":"刻む内容は……新たに生まれる者への期待や、失われるかもしれない命への祝福といったものだ。","source_cn":"对新生儿的期待，对可能消逝的生命的祝愿……诸如此类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54AF9CFEB2FA3E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910626008:1":{"text":"つまりここは……あなたたちが願いを残す場所？ハダルたちということは、カーリュさんやコネットのも？","source_cn":"所以这是……你们各自留下愿望的地方？所有深海族裔，包括...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8099D88EB0A8FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910626009:1":{"text":"はい。","source_cn":"对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAAE344DA30C35B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"願いを刻む？","source