0:1910626018:1":{"text":"願いは、その者が存在した証しじゃ。わしが願いを守ってきたように、願いもわしを守ってくれておるのかもしれん。じゃが、もう長いこと新しい願いを見ておらんのう……","source_cn":"心愿是人存在过的证明，我保护它们，也许它们也保护我。只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA2C0AC987FC165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910626019:1":{"text":"だから理性を保っていられるのか？","source_cn":"所以你能保持理智？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99130744B3B4537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910626020:1":{"text":"太鼓の音は今も聞こえておる。わしはただ、それを聞かないことにしただけじゃ。","source_cn":"鼓声正在持续，我听得到。我只是选择不去听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEF89CC04288BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"どうして理性を保っていられるんだ！？","source_cn":"你还保持着理智？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43D7682D15418F9D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうして理性を保っていられるんだ！？","female":"どうして理性を保っていられるの！？","variant_male_record_index":"96022","variant_female_record_index":"96023","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910626021:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンが何なのかは知らんが、リトラなら一人知っておるぞ。","source_cn":"我不知道什么是亡灵，但见过一个浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77D432C16F335642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910626022:1":{"text":"あやつは何度もここへ来ておる。まっすぐここへ泳いできて、願いを刻みたいと言ったから、通してやったのじゃ。","source_cn":"他来过这里，许多次。他径直游来，想留刻心愿，于是我放他通行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E7757DDCDF47F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910626023:1":{"text":"どんな奴かも知らないのに通したのか！？","source_cn":"你不认识他，干嘛帮他？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42578D673139D3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910626024:1":{"text":"ここは願いが集まる場所。願う者は拒まんよ。","source_cn":"此处是愿望齐聚之地，没人应被拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA792D3086C46B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910626025:1":{"text":"あの、ここに刻まれた内容を読んでもいいですか？","source_cn":"先生，我们可以看看这里的刻印吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F35A6C7D6AD4C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910626026:1":{"text":"もちろんだとも。よければ、おぬしらの願いも刻んでいくといい。","source_cn":"请便，也欢迎刻录你们自己的心愿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61F5B56549732D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:3:4":{"text":"ここでグレイヴボーンを見たことはあるか？","source_cn":"你有没有见过一个亡灵？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xx